      "text": "It's very striking to see how AI is being applied in several contexts. And even more striking to find apps like mined generations being funded while assisted technology that can improve lives of others are still struggling to find this kind of funding. I guess we can do much better to bridge the gap that is currently separating the access to education information of the different countries, different communities and countries. Here, I want to present potential tools based on AI that can help in the communication of deaf communities and hearing people. We can build sign languages, a build translator of sign languages, and text and audio. For example, to have as an input a sequence of frames to trap the movement and the shape and other characteristics of the signs to audio or text in different or languages.",
