      "duration": 57.52,
      "text": "To start training a sign language model, we need to collect data, record videos and annotate samples. In this case, I am presenting to you the interface of Elon, a platform that helps us to annotate the video in two tires, for example. The first one will help us to annotate individual signs, sign by sign when it starts, when it ends. And another tire that can help us to provide the whole sentence that several signs or glosses are part of. Another stage in this training model is when we have to track the key point landmarks. This is just one way or one type of model to train in this case, we're using this type of information, which are the key point landmarks.",
