      "text": "And this important to track not only the hands movements and shapes, but also as I mentioned before, the pose and the facial gestures, which are all part of the signs and sign languages. We have tools like MediaPipe by Google, and I can see very gladly that more and more research is being done in this area. After we have these annotations of the data, we can start training the model and giving the model several examples of one sign in this case for the sign to open the door. For example, in the first, with the first subject, now, hello, cat, and not only several variations or examples from one same individual, but examples from several individuals will help to train the model and be able to recognize the sign of any other person that stands in front of the camera, which is using them all.",
